  <div class=3D"sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content=3D""><p clas=
s=3D"" style=3D"white-space:pre-wrap;">&nbsp;As a photographer of interiors=
 and gardens, it always seemed a natural progression to begin photographing=
 <a href=3D"https://www.markboltonphotography.co.uk/hotel-photography" targ=
et=3D"_blank" tabindex=3D"-1">hotels</a>;  for the last fifteen years I hav=
e been photographing some of the best in the world, especially in the UK bu=
t also through Europe.  I love the mix of rooms, exteriors, food, people an=
d places, and the challenge of moving around a busy hotel, trying not to ge=
t in the way, whilst photographing sometimes huge and impressive dining roo=
ms, terraces with world class views or small but perfectly formed bedrooms =
is one that I relish.  I can shoot food too, on location, and working with =
a top class chef is a buzz that I love.</p></div>


